; Run T only, and only while the host routes ~herokuapp.com to the lab DNS:
; brokenapp serves Heroku's "No such app", liveapp a normal page, every other
; name (ghostapp included) is NXDOMAIN. Both addresses are the lab's web host.
$ORIGIN herokuapp.com.
$TTL 30
@                   IN SOA  ns1.uslab.test. hostmaster.uslab.test. 1 3600 600 86400 30
@                   IN NS   ns1.uslab.test.
brokenapp           IN A    192.88.97.10
liveapp             IN A    192.88.97.10
